<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets $200 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets $200 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANKERS TRUST CO</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     1/16 PCT  PAY DATE    07.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   16.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  6.50 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
